---
title: "Full run: python main.py with MODE = \"stages\" (Stages 0, 1-3, master report)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Main as main.py
    participant Cfg as FrameworkConfig
    participant Space as SEARCH_SPACE
    participant Run as run.start_run
    participant S0 as stage0.run_stage0
    participant St as stages.run_stages
    participant RS as stages.run_stage
    participant MR as reporting.write_master

    User->>Main: python main.py (settings at the top of the file)
    Main->>Cfg: build_config(): FrameworkConfig().with_overrides(...)
    Cfg-->>Main: cfg
    Main->>Space: make(cfg.hyperparams)
    Space-->>Main: candidate (values outside the allowed ranges are rejected)
    Main->>Run: start_run(cfg)
    Note over Run: results/<run_id>/, config.json, run.log,<br/>fixed seeds, ArtifactCache
    Run-->>Main: RunContext ctx
    alt STAGE0_DIR is None
        Main->>S0: run_stage0(ctx, candidate)
        S0-->>Main: Stage0Result (stage_0/ folder with plan files)
    else a finished Stage 0 folder is given
        Note over Main: reuse its plan files
    end
    Main->>St: run_stages(ctx, candidate, stage0_dir)
    loop stage 1 (quantization), 2 (pruning), 3 (KV cache), when methods are listed
        St->>RS: run_stage(ctx, stage, method names, candidate, stage0_dir)
        RS-->>St: stage_N/report.md, stage_N_comparison.xlsx, results.json
    end
    Note over St: Stage 2 also runs "<pruning>_after_<quantization>"<br/>for each method in STAGE2_AFTER (path 0 -> 1 -> 2 -> 4)
    St-->>Main: output paths
    Main->>MR: write_master(ctx.run_dir)
    MR-->>Main: master_report.md, all_stages_comparison.xlsx
    Main-->>User: prints every output path
    Note over Main: Other MODEs (single, sweep, compare_scores, prune_sweep,<br/>threshold_sweep) are Stage 0 studies that stop after Stage 0
